PlasMacintosh Licensing
=======================

PlasMacintosh is a mixed hardware/software research project.

Hardware designs, mechanical designs, schematics, and associated hardware
documentation are licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 -
Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0).

See:
LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt

Software, simulation code, data-acquisition code, analysis code, and other
source code are licensed under the MIT License.

See:
LICENSES/MIT.txt

Experimental datasets may be released under separate terms specified with
the applicable dataset.

